   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Producer starts at phase 1 (make_pipeline_state, Producer): a fresh barrier is in phase 0, and a wait for the\npreceding phase's parity returns at once, so the first five acquires pass without a consumer. At tile 5 the\nproducer waits on empty[0] for phase 0, which completes only when the consumer has released tile 0.\nConsumer starts at phase 0; its first wait on full[0] blocks until the producer's arrival plus the TMA\nbytes complete that phase.",
   "fontSize": 13,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "Producer starts at phase 1 (make_pipeline_state, Producer): a fresh barrier is in phase 0, and a wait for the\npreceding phase's parity returns at once, so the first five acquires pass without a consumer. At tile 5 the\nproducer waits on empty[0] for phase 0, which completes only when the consumer has released tile 0.\nConsumer starts at phase 0; its first wait on full[0] blocks until the producer's arrival plus the TMA\nbytes complete that phase.",
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true,
   "baseline": 13
  }
